{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5782a90656dd7454374a49589550ecf5c7bd1c93708b3542ac112fd0b8b5e2b7", "ja": "（ついに瑞希の初公演が始まる。開演の準備は\nばっちりだ。あとは瑞希の支度が終われば……）", "zh": "（瑞希的首次公演终于要开始了。\n开演工作已经准备完成。接下来就等瑞希做好准备……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d63b8b2d06d4315f38c8c8044bae86bf422dd0c373c390b2b81e846fea0ad247", "ja": "お、瑞希。準備終わったんだな？", "zh": "喔？瑞希，你准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "7166c06e2284107dfd36e4f43cb40293ca32d581e60ead25288ebd96ccbfd106", "ja": "はい、終わりました。これが、アイドル衣装……\nとても、キラキラしています。", "zh": "是，我准备好了。这就是偶像的服装……\n非常闪耀亮眼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "8124251d09f869593e80e7ec95b6318a4b1599dfe779d6212fa5c12274aeeac3", "ja": "{$P$}。\nこの衣装は、似合っているでしょうか？", "zh": "{$P$}。\n这套服装适合我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1005_p", "source_sha256": "8e49a9d23fa805653bd3b96457bae9ed3d9911dbdb31ee43e4a1729b3fd4d21e", "ja": "うん、瑞希によく似合ってるぞ。\nステージが待ちきれないみたいだな。", "zh": "嗯，瑞希穿起来很适合。\n看来你迫不及待想要登台了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "5ce969cd2d9d2e129517a84e9f3d9d988cb5802fdcb85a3a42a16e39b7dd46b9", "ja": "そのことなんですが、{$P$}。\n少し、相談したいことがあります。", "zh": "是这样的，{$P$}。\n我有件事想跟你商量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d066fe0b7b60c42c8e2cc95364f1db18ad9df446ce7239e67e3398cd99718bf0", "ja": "うん？　なんだろう。", "zh": "嗯？什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "d1368fef7789c953856ded4f0c409ccb8d3a8d570790c2893aed4e792bf8b224", "ja": "はい。\n実はこう見えて、とても緊張しています。", "zh": "谢谢。\n你可能看不出来，其实我现在非常紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2a1c60d33fe8c20d35ad0683c7ce43f871f8fc0d10d2ea470122d5e4f2c01652", "ja": "え、そうなのか？\n落ち着いて見えたから、てっきり……。", "zh": "咦？是吗？\n你看起来很冷静，我还以为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "ea12e33c71cc9e60e987c778dd0b39ff5c07f65c7e7937b70ba13c1f0c8d3cda", "ja": "はい。控え室で、緑茶に砂糖を入れてしまったくらい\n緊張しています。どうしたらいいでしょう。", "zh": "是的，我紧张到在准备室时不小心在绿茶里放了砂糖。\n我该怎么办才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "5eb93a5c24da127934762d265ba4743ba5f4f030ce7eaf7656e2e176d22c3cad", "ja": "{$P$}、アドバイスをください。\n3択でお願いします。", "zh": "{$P$}，请给我一些建议。\n麻烦给我三个选项。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1012_p", "source_sha256": "37ea2f3a6bdf0e99dfb33af05e99f40203c3e1ffae4dfa50650a8798356933b7", "ja": "俺が3択を考えるのか……？", "zh": "你要我想三个选项吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "77b8c0e803bbf7106e4445aab818d3ec8fe2ef77180be1aa4f0e15e94dd4b3b8", "ja": "はい、そこから私が選びます。\nどうぞ。", "zh": "是的，我会从里面选一个。\n请讲吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3bf492d37113e608956f2b57dfedf5bc7c37589af8bb3c67d020ba4f2fd1b8de", "ja": "わ、わかった。そうだな……じゃあ、", "zh": "好、好吧。三个选项是吧……那就这样吧──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1015_p", "source_sha256": "08e743588e9e45b0286384b850999eaff1fad9952e7a2397b50b6bd39899a7eb", "ja": "『好きなことをする』\n『ストレッチをする』『早口言葉を言う』", "zh": "『做喜欢的事情』、\n『伸展身体』、『讲绕口令』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "940310ea33efd946cac59cf22b9d33f2c49860e7199841714a4e60f651ad0ae4", "ja": "ありがとうございます。ええと、『好きなことをする』\n『ストレッチをする』『早口言葉を言う』……。", "zh": "谢谢你提供选项。我想想，『做喜欢的事情』、\n『伸展身体』、『讲绕口令』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "d6018db06dd5b2f2285ece01fe19ad1c0f6a6a08f71dd919970eb7f1fbdf0643", "ja": "{$P$}。困りました。\nどの選択肢も捨てがたくて、選べません。", "zh": "{$P$}，这下伤脑筋了。\n三个选项都难以抉择，我选不出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "20f7ad8c9b714edfe897069b7aae1810d2a713467d07ddbc04f454d99490558e", "ja": "なので、代わりに選んでもらえると助かります。\nどうぞ。", "zh": "所以，希望你可以替我选一个。\n请吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1019_p", "source_sha256": "57f456d1dbb1795645d2068b468ebaadbafec2903fbfa54542826f441d0c0ea1", "ja": "自分で出した3択を自分で選ぶのか……わかった。\nじゃあ、正解は……", "zh": "我自己想完三个选项，还要自己选一个吗……好吧。\n那么，正确答案是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1020_p", "source_sha256": "a64b6b3eff98a65dee7f4809e4bd918c7f7491c3b05c5c384cfd12335419aed4", "ja": "『ストレッチをする』かな。\n本番前には大切なことだし。", "zh": "『伸展身体』吧。\n毕竟这在正式表演前是不可或缺的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "8b63c052608330801cf1f8d9c33fff721ef45302032960b74077f54909dd5c9d", "ja": "なるほど……。\nさすが、{$P$}です。", "zh": "原来如此……\n不愧是{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1022_p", "source_sha256": "6a55c385776db095a2ad52a5f7b77db649c643e2a2baac76741ed4b604189a0c", "ja": "いや、それほどでも……。", "zh": "还好吧，没那么夸张啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "10ca579c7b080ed3f40225e449773c04c32a67113bc5e777e5a62414893eb850", "ja": "私の好きなことは、クロスワードパズルです。ですが、\n解けないとモヤモヤしてしまって、よくありません。", "zh": "我喜欢的事情是玩填字游戏。不过，\n要是解不开的话会很烦躁，反而适得其反。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1024_044miz", "source_sha256": "12ba0c1d45cb09f5541728e204b0556c21de446139739906dbed3b3d79defb5e", "ja": "早口言葉は難度が高いです。バスガシュばくはちゅ。\n……噛みました。", "zh": "而绕口令则是太难了。吃葡萄不吐补岛鼻。\n……吃螺丝了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1025_044miz", "source_sha256": "a2c6a63526d34ddad8352e97563aa3c1a1b33573bd07a09fe84a92be88c252a1", "ja": "なので、ここはストレッチが正解かと。\n早速、レッスンルームに行きましょう。", "zh": "因此，我也认为伸展身体就是正确答案。\n我们赶快前往练习室吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1026_044miz", "source_sha256": "1e3f0c36361e895f2cdc503e1f22e7471c34ed7100c4a0051297630c806328c0", "ja": "いち、に、さん、し。にーに、さん、し。\n……ふぅ。このくらいでしょうか。", "zh": "一、二、三、四，二、二、三、四。\n……呼，这样就行了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1027_p", "source_sha256": "414d011a86aa48a5de79120a51fedaf9f17adcb4b7e9c23f059ac6926e551b9f", "ja": "うん、上出来だ。\nずいぶん体がほぐれたんじゃないか？", "zh": "嗯，很好。\n身体是不是放松了不少呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1028_044miz", "source_sha256": "de06bae9604adc2f3b0bf609fa989fd739869d5d4432c535f6c52a6b5e980f7c", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\n{$P$}が手伝ってくれたおかげです。", "zh": "非常感谢。\n这都多亏有{$P$}帮忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1029_p", "source_sha256": "ba126e39a60194fc7c24faf10e8ef071dfa0a33dd03d5406305bf57c0aa9172e", "ja": "緊張の方はどうだ。\n少しは良くなったか？", "zh": "你还会紧张吗？\n有比较好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1030_044miz", "source_sha256": "74d292005819b5e0a4584a5690e94ea3f02af9f36390234b87ff9d325b762d05", "ja": "はい。おかげさまで、だいぶ落ち着きました。\n体と一緒に、心もほぐれたみたいです。", "zh": "有的，多亏有你的协助，我的情绪平静下来了。\n看来我的内心也跟着身体一起放松了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1031_p", "source_sha256": "52ab2e7e27d710d22ad1306c6db5022dc988b018a0cb96d46f338f9893f1d52b", "ja": "よかった。\nこれで安心してステージに立てるな。", "zh": "太好了。\n这样你就能放心表演了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1032_044miz", "source_sha256": "a168fc7e3c6e532b8c1376be98fb80262d735d13d9952ea31bc44ec7552af279", "ja": "はい。……背中を押す{$P$}の手、\n暖かかったな。", "zh": "是的……{$P$}，你的手支撑着我，\n非常地温暖。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1033_044miz", "source_sha256": "1a73bd94f20680aebd3c603314206bcb112512d56b0cbfdc1376be515e16829f", "ja": "私の背中は、\n{$P$}が支えてくれているんですね。", "zh": "其实{$P$}一直都像这样，\n在背后支撑着我吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1034_p", "source_sha256": "26a34366326411708e4e852c3d93a46da108a080bb43d6c3364cd10ca137daa1", "ja": "はは、そうだな。\n必要なら、またいつでも押すから。", "zh": "哈哈，是啊。\n有需要的话，我随时都能再撑你一把。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1035_044miz", "source_sha256": "f0ce56e740f5b102cc8643eeae94a5211cee37cbcf74a09e2078ec9492258ddc", "ja": "はい。ありがとうございます。\n{$P$}、見ていてください。", "zh": "好的，非常感谢你。\n{$P$}，请你看好吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1036_044miz", "source_sha256": "9884abee4e8d63bf434fd3e0d3bdfd919769829c3b45efd126b5770f699505bc", "ja": "このドキドキを、ワクワクに変えてみせます。\n……頑張るぞ。", "zh": "把紧张不安转变为兴奋期待。\n……我要加油哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1037_p", "source_sha256": "0a45fceadb685920be22b5ec4399ae8210b9b4d22e853862bac5456383f9eb90", "ja": "（そう言って、瑞希は手のひらをぎゅっと握り締め、\nしっかりとした足取りでステージへと向かった）", "zh": "（瑞希说完后，握紧拳头，\n踏着稳健的脚步迈向舞台。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_003_1038_p", "source_sha256": "20ed9e72108ee8974140f7d93eaffeae482ba50b51b522f229a2864c4d30d6b3", "ja": "（いよいよ、アイドル真壁瑞希の始まりだ。\n新しいアイドルの誕生に、みんなきっと驚くぞ！）", "zh": "（偶像真壁瑞希终于要起步了。\n观众目睹新偶像的诞生，肯定会大为惊艳！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
